{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live, Grow, and Adventure with Your Favorite VTubers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VTuber Adventure Village</strong> is a multiplayer online casual adventure game that combines <strong>virtual streamer interaction</strong> with <strong>role-playing elements</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for both VTubers and their fans, the game seamlessly blends life simulation, resource gathering, village building, and community interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, every village is led by a unique VTuber.<br>They are not fictional NPCs, but real creators and streamers you already know and support\u2014joining you in daily life, adventures, and interactions within the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an \u201cAdventurer,\u201d you will enter the dedicated server of your favorite VTuber,<br>gather resources, contribute to village growth, and take part in building a thriving community together with other players.<br>Through special quests and mini-games, you can create memorable interactions with the VTubers themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>VTuber Adventure Village</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each server is a world shaped by the unique style of its VTuber.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each journey is a story co-written with the village leader.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a brand-new adventure that connects VTubers, players, and communities.<br>Here, the game is not just about playing\u2014it\u2019s about growing, sharing, and experiencing together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782530/extras/a9a0d8466722e46be3837e4ab76e5dbf.avif?t=1762178599\" width=1296 height=734 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Activities</strong>: Mine rare resources, go fishing, and hunt wild creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong>: Collect items to unlock outfits and create your own unique style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanding Content</strong>: Ongoing updates bring new challenges and more appearance options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Interaction</strong>: Join VTuber-led events, contribute to village development, and complete community missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxed Companion Experience</strong>: Strengthen the bond between VTubers and fans in a shared game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782530/extras/9f373799af6455f6fe5f5ed96695ada6.avif?t=1762178599\" width=1296 height=734 /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3782530?t=1762178599","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782530/2878106c0fd8e301fea28239bbd5aed8be1e52c4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762178599","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782530/c21da023c1d0eca2effdf8399328e45a23ae28c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762178599","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782530/c21da023c1d0eca2effdf8399328e45a23ae28c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762178599","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live, Grow, and Adventure with Your Favorite VTubers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VTuber Adventure Village</strong> is a multiplayer online casual adventure game that combines <strong>virtual streamer interaction</strong> with <strong>role-playing elements</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for both VTubers and their fans, the game seamlessly blends life simulation, resource gathering, village building, and community interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, every village is led by a unique VTuber.<br>They are not fictional NPCs, but real creators and streamers you already know and support\u2014joining you in daily life, adventures, and interactions within the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an \u201cAdventurer,\u201d you will enter the dedicated server of your favorite VTuber,<br>gather resources, contribute to village growth, and take part in building a thriving community together with other players.<br>Through special quests and mini-games, you can create memorable interactions with the VTubers themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>VTuber Adventure Village</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each server is a world shaped by the unique style of its VTuber.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each journey is a story co-written with the village leader.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a brand-new adventure that connects VTubers, players, and communities.<br>Here, the game is not just about playing\u2014it\u2019s about growing, sharing, and experiencing together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782530/extras/a9a0d8466722e46be3837e4ab76e5dbf.avif?t=1762178599\" width=1296 height=734 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Activities</strong>: Mine rare resources, go fishing, and hunt wild creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong>: Collect items to unlock outfits and create your own unique style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanding Content</strong>: Ongoing updates bring new challenges and more appearance options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Interaction</strong>: Join VTuber-led events, contribute to village development, and complete community missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxed Companion Experience</strong>: Strengthen the bond between VTubers and fans in a shared game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782530/extras/9f373799af6455f6fe5f5ed96695ada6.avif?t=1762178599\" width=1296 height=734 /></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["RainSakura","ZerovHao"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782530/f769f985c0dd05b16ddf69576dd6118ba53412db/header.jpg?t=1762178599","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12.7.6<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> All Is Well<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Should Have One<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Should Have One</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 13/14/15<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> All Is Well<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Should Have One<br>